.* QUIWRKDEVD: WRKDEVD, the device descriptions with their options.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE=ACTION.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=HINTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 19'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TEXTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 50'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=POSTO CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=POSHINT CLASS=HINTCL VALUE='Starting characters'.
:VAR NAME=OPT CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=DEVD CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=DEVTYPE CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=DEVTEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:LISTDEF NAME=DEVS VARS='OPT DEVD DEVTYPE DEVTEXT'.
:KEYL NAME=KEYS HELP=KEYSHLP.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5'.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F6 ACTION='RETURN 6'.F6=Create
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F14 ACTION='RETURN 14'.F14=Work with status
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKDEVD KEYL=KEYS HELP=WRKDEVDH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Work with Device Descriptions
:DATA DEPTH=2.
:DATACOL WIDTH=22.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI VAR=POSTO USAGE=INPUT.Position to
:DATAIX VAR=POSHINT USAGE=OUTPUT.
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=DEVS SCROLL=YES.(No device descriptions)
:LISTACT OPTION=2 ENTER='CMD ?CHGDEVD DEVD(&DEVD.)'.2=Change
:LISTACT OPTION=3 ENTER='CMD ?CRTDEVDSP'.3=Copy
:LISTACT OPTION=4 ENTER='CMD DLTDEVD DEVD(&DEVD.)'.4=Delete
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='CMD DSPDEVD DEVD(&DEVD.)'.5=Display
:LISTACT OPTION=6 ENTER='CMD DSPDEVD DEVD(&DEVD.) OUTPUT(*PRINT)'.6=Print
:LISTACT OPTION=7 ENTER='CMD ?RNMOBJ OBJ(QSYS/&DEVD.) OBJTYPE(*DEVD)'.7=Rename
:LISTACT OPTION=8 ENTER='CMD WRKCFGSTS CFGTYPE(*DEV) CFGD(&DEVD.)'.8=Work with status
:LISTACT OPTION=9 ENTER='RETURN 109'.9=Retrieve source
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=DEVD USAGE=OUTPUT.Device
:LISTCOL VAR=DEVTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT.Type
:LISTCOL VAR=DEVTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Text
:ELIST.
:CMDLINE SIZE=SHORT.Parameters or command
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=WRKDEVDH.Work with Device Descriptions - Help
:P.The device descriptions in name order, with their type and text.
Type an option next to a device to change, copy, delete, display,
print or rename its description, see its status or get the command
that would create it. Type a name in Position to and press Enter to
start the list there.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=KEYSHLP.Function keys - Help
:P.F5 shows the list again, F6 creates a description, F14 shows the
status of every device, F9 brings back the last command, F3 and F12
leave.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
